{"id":"0093518f9d6f395e","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-ax-equality-function-substitution.md","title":"Equality Function Substitution Axiom","display":"ax-equality-function-substitution — Equality Function Substitution Axiom","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-ax-equality-function-substitution","aliases":["58-ax-equality-function-substitution"],"display":"ax-equality-function-substitution — Equality Function Substitution Axiom","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-ax-equality-function-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-ax-equality-function-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-equality-function-substitution — Equality Function Substitution Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 是一阶签名，其函数符号集与函数元数映射分别记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{\\mathrm{fn}}\">\\(a_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\">\\(f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)\\in\\omega\">\\(a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)\\in\\omega\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar s,\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}\">\\(\\bar s,\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 是该签名的项集</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_\\Sigma\\coloneqq(v_0\\doteq v_0)\">\\(\\top_\\Sigma\\coloneqq(v_0\\doteq v_0)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,n)\\)</span> 是本文件定义的有限等式合取公式码</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_n=\\bar s(n)\">\\(s_n=\\bar s(n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_n=\\bar t(n)\">\\(t_n=\\bar t(n)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,n)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\leq a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)\">\\(n\\leq a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)\\)</span>。公式码中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\land\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\land\\psi\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\neg\\psi)\">\\(\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\neg\\psi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\to\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\to\\psi\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\)</span>，均采用所引语法构造子。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eq\\text{-}finite\\text{-}conjunction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,0)\\coloneqq\\top_\\Sigma,\n\\qquad\nn\\in a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)\\ \\to\\ \\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,n+1)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,n)\\land(s_n\\doteq t_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eq\\text{-}finite\\text{-}conjunction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,0)\\coloneqq\\top_\\Sigma,\n\\qquad\nn\\in a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)\\ \\to\\ \\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,n+1)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,n)\\land(s_n\\doteq t_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}eq\\text{-}func\\text{-}subst}\\vdash\n\\forall f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\;\\forall\\bar s,\\bar t\\in\n\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f))\n\\to f(\\bar s)\\doteq f(\\bar t)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}eq\\text{-}func\\text{-}subst}\\vdash\n\\forall f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\;\\forall\\bar s,\\bar t\\in\n\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f))\n\\to f(\\bar s)\\doteq f(\\bar t)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该公理表达等词在<strong>函数符号</strong>上的代入性质</li>\n<li>这是等号的同余公理模式；它只断言函数符号保持逐项相等，不涉及公式替换或“对变量自由”的额外侧条件。</li>\n<li>零元函数的前件是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_\\Sigma\">\\(\\top_\\Sigma\\)</span>；有限合取由递归显式给出，不依赖未声明的可变元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\">\\(\\bigwedge\\)</span> 构造子。</li>\n<li>该公理保证：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i = t_i\">\\(s_i = t_i\\)</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\ldots, s_i, \\ldots) = f(\\ldots, t_i, \\ldots)\">\\(f(\\ldots, s_i, \\ldots) = f(\\ldots, t_i, \\ldots)\\)</span> 成立</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 是一阶签名，其函数符号集与函数元数映射分别记作 $\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}$ 与 $a_{\\mathrm{fn}}$（see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}","display":false},{"tex":"a_{\\mathrm{fn}}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}","display":false},{"tex":"a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar s,\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_\\Sigma\\coloneqq(v_0\\doteq v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,n)","display":false},{"tex":"s_n=\\bar s(n)","display":false},{"tex":"t_n=\\bar t(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,n)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\leq a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\land\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\neg\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\to\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}eq\\text{-}finite\\text{-}conjunction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,0)\\coloneqq\\top_\\Sigma,\n\\qquad\nn\\in a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)\\ \\to\\ \\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,n+1)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,n)\\land(s_n\\doteq t_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}eq\\text{-}func\\text{-}subst}\\vdash\n\\forall f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\;\\forall\\bar s,\\bar t\\in\n\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{EqConj}_\\Sigma(\\bar s,\\bar t,a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f))\n\\to f(\\bar s)\\doteq f(\\bar t)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge","display":false},{"tex":"s_i = t_i","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\ldots, s_i, \\ldots) = f(\\ldots, t_i, \\ldots)","display":false}],"bytes":2244,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-equality-function-substitution.md|58-ax-equality-function-substitution]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093"]}